hildren_topics":[{"title":"魏燕之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0740"},{"title":"北魏统一北方的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0718"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○冯氏袭燕旧壤。司隶治和龙，以并、青二州镇白狼[白狼城，...","context_before":"...二年，魏兵复围和龙，大略而还。燕日危蹙，因请迎于高句丽。","source_end_index":403,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8f48e4e3-5363-5926-9f39-5d4cfe223cd4","source_start_index":370,"source_text":"十三年，魏将娥清等复伐燕，高丽来迎，弘遂焚和龙而东，旋为高丽所杀。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、辽东行都司（卷三十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"胡氏曰：慕容翰议以偏师从北道攻高丽，即此丰道云。○白岩城...","context_before":"...此，谓之丰城。司马懿伐辽东，丰人南徙青齐，其留者曰北丰。","source_end_index":89,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9831db44-0293-5ec4-84eb-90cc5f858448","source_start_index":51,"source_text":"宋元嘉十五年，北燕主冯弘奔高丽，至辽东，高丽处之平郭，既而徙之北丰，寻杀之。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/八、辽东行都司（卷三十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["外交","权争"],"content":"3初，燕王弘至遼東，高麗王璉遣使勞之曰：「龍城王馮君，爰適野次，士馬勞乎？」弘慙怒，稱制讓之；高麗處之平郭，尋徙北豐。弘素侮高麗，政刑賞罰，猶如其國；高麗乃奪其侍人，取其太子王仁爲質。弘怨高麗，遣使上表求迎，上遣使者王白駒等迎之，幷令高麗資遣。高麗王不欲使弘南來，遣將孫漱、高仇等殺弘于北豐，幷其子孫十餘人，諡弘曰昭成皇帝。白駒等帥所領七千餘人掩討漱、仇、殺仇，生擒漱。高麗王以白駒等專殺，遣使執送之。上以遠國，不欲違其意，下白駒等獄，已而原之。","content_fanyi":"当初，北燕王冯弘到达辽东，高丽王高琏派使者慰劳他说：“龙城王冯君来到野外停驻，人马都很辛劳吧？”冯弘又羞又怒，用皇帝的名义下诏责备高琏；高丽把他安置在平郭，不久又迁到北丰。冯弘一向轻视高丽，推行政令、施行赏罚，仍像在自己的国家一样；高丽于是夺走他的侍从，抓走他的太子冯王仁作为人质。冯弘怨恨高丽，派使者向刘宋朝廷上表，请求迎他南归，宋文帝刘义隆派使者王白驹等人前去迎接，并命令高丽出资遣送。高丽王不愿让冯弘南下，派将领孙漱、高仇等人在北丰杀死冯弘，连同他的子孙十余人，追谥冯弘为昭成皇帝。王白驹等人率领所统辖的七千余人掩袭讨击孙漱、高仇，杀死高仇，活捉孙漱。高丽王认为王白驹等人擅自杀人，派使者把他们逮捕送回。宋文帝因为高丽是远方的国家，不想违背高丽的心意，便将王白驹等人关进监狱，不久又赦免了他们。","content_jianti_auto":"3初，燕王弘至辽东，高丽王琏遣使劳之曰：「龙城王冯君，爰适野次，士马劳乎？」弘慙怒，称制让之；高丽处之平郭，寻徙北丰。弘素侮高丽，政刑赏罚，犹如其国；高丽乃夺其侍人，取其太子王仁为质。弘怨高丽，遣使上表求迎，上遣使者王白驹等迎之，幷令高丽资遣。高丽王不欲使弘南来，遣将孙漱、高仇等杀弘于北丰，幷其子孙十余人，谥弘曰昭成皇帝。白驹等帅所领七千余人掩讨漱、仇、杀仇，生擒漱。高丽王以白驹等专杀，遣使执送之。上以远国，不欲违其意，下白驹等狱，已而原之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11384,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a8156a26-db0e-11ef-9ffb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"黃門侍郞","official_note":"黃門侍郞是東漢至魏晉南北朝時期的官職，隸屬門下省，負責侍從皇帝、傳達詔令和審核奏章，屬於宮廷內的重要文官。在《資治通鑑》此段中，殷淳曾任此職，其女被納為太子妃，顯示其家族地位。此信息基於歷史常識，黃門侍郞在南北朝時期品秩約為正四品。","official_rank":"正四品","source_snippet":"故黃門侍郞殷淳女","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"37c972b4-df09-4164-a784-968695732d44"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"殷淳","people_name_jianti_auto":"殷淳","people_xingming":"殷淳","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a8156a51-db0e-11ef-812f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":424,"link_death_year":453,"link_td_description":"刘劭，字休远，彭城绥舆里（今江苏省徐州市铜山区）人。他是中国南北朝时期刘宋宋文帝刘义隆的长子，母为皇后袁齐妫。宋文帝晚年因刘劭与女巫严道育交往及行巫蛊而谋废其太子之位，刘劭于是先发制人发起兵变弑父夺位。但即位不久即遭三弟武陵王刘骏为首的军队讨伐，兵败被杀，在位仅一百日。《宋书》称刘劭为“元凶”，因刘劭杀父夺位，不用刘劭为文帝上的庙号及谥号，亦不承认刘劭为刘宋的正统皇帝。","link_td_id":"Q10000528","link_td_number_id":167708,"people_name":"劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"劭","people_xingming":"刘劭","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a8156a52-db0e-11ef-9c96-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4夏，四月，納故黃門侍郞殷淳女爲太子劭妃。","content_fanyi":"夏季四月，刘宋文帝刘义隆为太子刘劭娶已故黄门侍郎殷淳的女儿为妃。","content_jianti_auto":"4夏，四月，纳故黄门侍郞殷淳女为太子劭妃。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11385,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a8156a50-db0e-11ef-9ee6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":4,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a8156a54-db0e-11ef-8b55-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5五月，戊寅，魏大赦。","content_fanyi":"五月戊寅日，北魏实行大赦。","content_jianti_auto":"5五月，戊寅，魏大赦。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11386,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a8156a53-db0e-11ef-98f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"天山","place_name_jianti_auto":"天山","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a8156a57-db0e-11ef-885f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a8156a58-db0e-11ef-8c74-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鐵勒","place_name_jianti_auto":"铁勒","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a8156a59-db0e-11ef-95dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"思結","place_name_jianti_auto":"思结","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a8156a5a-db0e-11ef-b3d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"多濫葛","place_name_jianti_auto":"多滥葛","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a8156a5b-db0e-11ef-84a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"a8156a5c-db0e-11ef-aab6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"折羅漫山","place_name_jianti_auto":"折罗漫山","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"a8156a5d-db0e-11ef-8ea0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白阜","place_name_jianti_auto":"白阜","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"a8156a5e-db0e-11ef-a85e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雪山","place_name_jianti_auto":"雪山","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a8156a5f-db0e-11ef-be41-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"天山在漠北，卽唐鐵勒思結、多濫葛所保之地，非伊吾之折羅漫山也。白阜，疑卽雪山。復，扶又翻。邪，讀曰耶。","note_content_jianti_auto":"天山在漠北，即唐铁勒思结、多滥葛所保之地，非伊吾之折罗漫山也。白阜，疑即雪山。复，扶又翻。邪，读曰耶。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"a8156a56-db0e-11ef-aace-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"樂平王","official_note":"樂平王是北魏的封王，通常授予皇室成員，負責地方治理或軍事指揮。在此上下文中，樂平王丕被任命督導東道軍隊，顯示其在軍事行動中的指揮角色。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"命樂平王丕督十五將出東道","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"4d296bec-d485-4eae-8ac5-13f7063fca4e"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"永昌王","official_note":"永昌王是北魏的封王，類似樂平王，用於封賞皇室或功臣，常參與地方或軍事事務。在此上下文中，永昌王健督導西道軍隊，表明其在北伐柔然中的軍事職責。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"永昌王健督十五將出西道","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"3d85230c-4bed-4fc0-972c-942bf2873d39"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"陳留王","official_note":"陳留王是北魏的封王，通常授予皇室成員，負責地方治理或軍事任務。在此上下文中，陳留王崇從中道分兵向涿邪山，顯示其在軍事行動中的指揮作用。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"陳留王崇從大澤向涿邪山","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"50f51490-5b97-4e57-aa2c-4ac13c0c0db6"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":444,"link_td_description":"拓跋丕，魏明元帝拓跋嗣次子，生母大慕容夫人，北魏宗室、官员。","link_td_id":"Q10003847","link_td_number_id":1124414,"people_name":"樂平王","people_name_jianti_auto":"乐平王","people_xingming":"拓跋丕","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"a8156a60-db0e-11ef-8f9b-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[拓跋]"},{"link_death_year":444,"link_td_description":"拓跋丕，魏明元帝拓跋嗣次子，生母大慕容夫人，北魏宗室、官员。","link_td_id":"Q10003847","link_td_number_id":1124414,"people_name":"丕","people_name_jianti_auto":"丕","people_xingming":"拓跋丕","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"a8156a61-db0e-11ef-9e4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":441,"link_td_description":"拓跋健，魏明元帝拓跋嗣第五子，生母尹夫人，北魏宗室、官员。","link_td_id":"Q10011821","link_td_number_id":1365063,"people_name":"永昌王","people_name_jianti_auto":"永昌王","people_xingming":"拓跋健","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a8156a62-db0e-11ef-9731-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":441,"link_td_description":"拓跋健，魏明元帝拓跋嗣第五子，生母尹夫人，北魏宗室、官员。","link_td_id":"Q10011821","link_td_number_id":1365063,"people_name":"健","people_name_jianti_auto":"健","p